    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS welcome  you to Applewood, an impressive modern residence extending to approximately 2,000 sq ft, ideally positioned in the highly regarded Croaghta Park, just off Glasheen Road.\r\n\r\nCombining contemporary design with a warm and welcoming atmosphere, Applewood offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in a convenient and established residential setting.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the generous proportions and thoughtful layout are immediately apparent. Bright, well-appointed living spaces provide an ideal environment for modern family life, while the home's scale offers excellent flexibility for entertaining, working from home and everyday living.\r\n\r\nAt approximately 2,000 sq ft, Applewood provides the generous accommodation increasingly sought after by today's buyers. The property offers a wonderful balance of open, sociable spaces and more private areas, making it equally suited to busy family life and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nLarge windows bring natural light throughout, while the modern presentation provides a blank canvas for the new owners to add their own personality and style.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nSet within Croaghta Park, off Glasheen Road, Applewood enjoys a well-connected residential location with convenient access to the amenities, services and transport links of the surrounding area within walking distance of University College Cork, Bons Secure Hospital, Cork City Centre, Cork University Hospital, Wilton Shopping Centre, a selection of both primary and secondary schools and a host of local amenities whilst also providing easy access to the South Link road network and public transportation. The setting combines the advantages of established suburban living with easy access to the city and its many attractions, making it an appealing choice for families,  and those seeking a substantial modern home in a convenient location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: - \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway, - \r\nlight filled entrance with laminate flooring  and feature cloak room with window.\r\n\r\nLiving room - 5.0m x 4.2m \r\nLaminate wood  flooring, bay widow, fire place with wood burning stove, double doors to kitchen\tand hall.\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 7.4m x 5.0m \r\nModern shaker kitchen with fitted floor & eye level units, with timber effect worktop. Large island with inset sink, feature worktop, underneath storage, breakfast bar & integrated dishwasher. Appliances include electric oven, hob, extractor hood. Subway tiled splashback and timber effect flooring\n\r\n\r\nUtility room - \r\nFloor and eye level storage units, tiled floor, plumbed for white goods, sink unit.\nBathroom: Extensively tiled with 3 piece suite.\r\n\r\nOffice / Study - 3.4m x 3.4m \r\nLaminate floor with window to rear.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 4.3m \r\nCarpet with window to front\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite bathroom - \r\nTiled with 3 piece suite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 5.5m x 4.0m \r\nCarpet with windows to rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 3.2m \r\nCarpet with window to rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.8m x 3.5m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
